started.</p>\n\n\n\n<h4 class=\"wp-block-heading\" id=\"Types-of-Tax-Sales-in-Luzerne-County\">Types of Tax Sales in Luzerne County</h4>\n\n\n\n<ol start=\"1\" class=\"wp-block-list\">\n<li><strong>Upset Sale</strong><br><br><strong>Details</strong>: Properties with delinquent taxes for two years are auctioned. Buyers must research these properties carefully as they come with existing liens and no warranties.<br><br><strong>Link</strong>: <a href=\"https://luzernecountytaxclaim.com/upsetsale.html\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><mark style=\"background-color:rgba(0, 0, 0, 0)\" class=\"has-inline-color has-vivid-cyan-blue-color\">Upset Sale Information</mark></a></li>\n\n\n\n<li><strong>Private Sale</strong><br><br><strong>Details</strong>: Subject to all liens and encumbrances. Requires approval from the taxing districts.<br><br><strong>Link</strong>: <a href=\"https://luzernecountytaxclaim.com/privatesale.html\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><mark style=\"background-color:rgba(0, 0, 0, 0)\" class=\"has-inline-color has-vivid-cyan-blue-color\">Private Sale Information</mark></a></li>\n\n\n\n<li><strong>Judicial Sale</strong><br><br><strong>Details</strong>: Properties not sold at Upset or Private Sales. These are sold free and clear of liens.<br><br><strong>Link</strong>: <a href=\"https://luzernecountytaxclaim.com/judicialsale.html\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><mark style=\"background-color:rgba(0, 0, 0, 0)\" class=\"has-inline-color has-vivid-cyan-blue-color\">Judicial Sale Information</mark></a></li>\n\n\n\n<li><strong>Repository Sale</strong><br><br><strong>Details</strong>: Sold without notice. Approval is required from all taxing districts.<br><br><strong>Link</strong>: <a href=\"https://luzernecountytaxclaim.com/repositorylist.html\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><mark style=\"background-color:rgba(0, 0, 0, 0)\" class=\"has-inline-color has-vivid-cyan-blue-color\">Repository Sale Information</mark></a></li>\n</ol>\n\n\n\n<h4 class=\"wp-block-heading\" id=\"Important-Details\">Important Details</h4>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-table\"><table class=\"has-fixed-layout\"><tbody><tr><th>Tax Sale Type</th><th>Typical Date</th><th>Bid Procedure</th><th>Sale Contact</th><th>Auction Site</th></tr><tr><td>Upset Sale</td><td>September</td><td>Premium Bid</td><td>Luzerne County Tax Claim Bureau</td><td><a href=\"https://maps.app.goo.gl/u6Q7zrfHRd4fBw2Q6\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><mark style=\"background-color:rgba(0, 0, 0, 0)\" class=\"has-inline-color has-vivid-cyan-blue-color\">Kings College Scandlon Gymnasium &#8211; Auxiliary Gym, 150 North Main Street, Wilkes-Barre</mark></a></td></tr><tr><td>Judicial Sale</td><td>August</td><td>Premium Bid</td><td>Luzerne County Tax Claim Bureau</td><td><a href=\"https://maps.app.goo.gl/u6Q7zrfHRd4fBw2Q6\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><mark style=\"background-color:rgba(0, 0, 0, 0)\" class=\"has-inline-color has-vivid-cyan-blue-color\">Kings College Scandlon Gymnasium &#8211; Auxiliary Gym, 150 North Main Street, Wilkes-Barre</mark></a></td></tr><tr><td>Private Sale</td><td>After Upset Sale</td><td>Premium Bid</td><td>Luzerne County Tax Claim Bureau</td><td>N/A</td></tr><tr><td>Repository Sale</td><td>After Judicial Sale</td><td>Premium Bid</td><td>Luzerne County Tax Claim Bureau</td><td>N/A</td></tr></tbody></table></figure>\n\n\n\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\" id=\"Steps-to-Start-Investing-in-Tax-Liens-or-Tax-Deeds\">Steps to Start Investing in Tax Liens or Tax Deeds</h3>\n\n\n\n<ol start=\"1\" class=\"wp-block-list\">\n<li><strong>Research and Understand Local Laws</strong><br><br>It&#8217;s crucial to know the legal framework and regulations specific to Luzerne County. Consult with an attorney for detailed advice.</li>\n\n\n\n<li><strong>Visit the Local Treasurer&#8217;s Website</strong><br><br>Check the Luzerne County Tax Claim Bureau website for detailed information and updates on tax sales.<br><a href=\"https://luzernecountytaxclaim.com/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><mark style=\"background-color:rgba(0, 0, 0, 0)\" class=\"has-inline-color has-vivid-cyan-blue-color\">Luzerne County Tax Claim Bureau</mark></a></li>\n\n\n\n<li><strong>Check the Auction Site</strong><br><br>Auctions are held at Kings College Scandlon Gymnasium. Be sure to verify the exact location and times.</li>\n\n\n\n<li><strong>Read the Details About Tax Liens or Tax Deeds</strong><br><br>Understand the sale schedules, property lists, and other essential details provided on the county’s website.</li>\n\n\n\n<li><strong>Contact the County Office</strong><br><br>For further inquiries, reach out to the Luzerne County Tax Claim Bureau directly.</li>\n</ol>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-full\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://vault.taxlienschool.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/12/Luzerne-County-Courthouse.webp 1081w,https://vault.taxlienschool.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/12/Luzerne-County-Courthouse-541x360.webp 541w,https://vault.taxlienschool.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/12/Luzerne-County-Courthouse-296x197.webp 296w,https://vault.taxlienschool.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/12/Luzerne-County-Courthouse-768x512.webp 768w,https://vault.taxlienschool.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/12/Luzerne-County-Courthouse-20x13.webp 20w,https://vault.taxlienschool.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/12/Luzerne-County-Courthouse-32x21.webp 32w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 1081px) 100vw, 1081px\" type=\"image/webp\"><img src=\"https://vault.taxlienschool.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/12/Luzerne-County-Courthouse.png\" height=\"720\" width=\"1081\" srcset=\"https://vault.taxlienschool.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/12/Luzerne-County-Courthouse.png 1081w, https://vault.taxlienschool.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/12/Luzerne-County-Courthouse-541x360.png 541w, https://vault.taxlienschool.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/12/Luzerne-County-Courthouse-296x197.png 296w, https://vault.taxlienschool.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/12/Luzerne-County-Courthouse-768x512.png 768w, https://vault.taxlienschool.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/12/Luzerne-County-Courthouse-20x13.png 20w, https://vault.taxlienschool.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/12/Luzerne-County-Courthouse-32x21.png 32w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 1081px) 100vw, 1081px\" class=\"wp-image-18271 sp-no-webp\" alt=\"Luzerne County Courthouse Pennsylvania\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"  > </picture></figure>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-buttons is-content-justification-center is-layout-flex wp-container-core-buttons-is-layout-16018d1d wp-block-buttons-is-layout-flex\">\n<div class=\"wp-block-button is-style-outline is-style-outline--1\"><a class=\"wp-block-button__link wp-element-button\" href=\"https://linktr.ee/dustinhahnrealestateinvesting\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">Click Here to Book a Call with Dustin Hahn</a></div>\n</div>\n\n\n\n<div style=\"height:30px\" aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"wp-block-spacer\"></div>\n\n\n\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\" id=\"Pro-Tips\">Pro Tips</h3>\n\n\n\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\">\n<li><strong>Prepare Diligently</strong>: Ensure all your documents and registrations are completed well in advance.</li>\n\n\n\n<li><strong>Consult an Attorney</strong>: To navigate legal complexities and ensure you’re fully compliant with all regulations.</li>\n\n\n\n<li><strong>Due Diligence</strong>: Thoroughly research properties, including checking for any existing liens or encumbrances.</li>\n</ul>\n\n\n\n<p><strong>Frequently Asked Questions</strong></p>\n\n\n\n<ol class=\"wp-block-list\">\n<li><strong>What is an Upset Sale?</strong><br><br>An Upset Sale is the first opportunity for the county to sell properties with delinquent taxes. The county sells properties with existing liens and encumbrances.</li>\n\n\n\n<li><strong>What happens if a property doesn&#8217;t sell at the Upset Sale?</strong><br><br>Unsold properties can move to a Private Sale, and if they remain unsold, they proceed to a Judicial Sale, where the county sells them free and clear of liens.</li>\n\n\n\n<li><strong>Can anyone participate in the tax sales?</strong><br><br>Yes, but participants must register in advance and meet specific requirements, including being current on all real estate taxes and municipal utility bills in Pennsylvania.</li>\n\n\n\n<li><strong>Do properties come with any guarantees?</strong><br><br>No guarantees or warranties accompany the sale of properties; buyers purchase them &#8220;as is.&#8221;.</li>\n\n\n\n<li><strong>What is the Repository Sale?</strong><br><br>The county places properties unsold at the Judicial Sale in the Repository, where buyers can submit bids subject to approval by all taxing districts.</li>\n</ol>\n\n\n\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\" id=\"Useful-Links\">Useful Links</h3>\n\n\n\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\">\n<li><a href=\"https://luzernecountytaxclaim.com/upsetsale.html\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><mark style=\"background-color:rgba(0, 0, 0, 0)\" class=\"has-inline-color has-vivid-cyan-blue-color\">Upset Sale Information</mark></a></li>\n\n\n\n<li><a href=\"https://luzernecountytaxclaim.com/privatesale.html\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><mark style=\"background-color:rgba(0, 0, 0, 0)\" class=\"has-inline-color has-vivid-cyan-blue-color\">Private Sale Information</mark></a></li>\n\n\n\n<li><a href=\"https://luzernecountytaxclaim.com/judicialsale.html\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><mark style=\"background-color:rgba(0, 0, 0, 0)\" class=\"has-inline-color has-vivid-cyan-blue-color\">Judicial Sale Information</mark></a></li>\n\n\n\n<li><a href=\"https://luzernecountytaxclaim.com/repositorylist.html\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><mark style=\"background-color:rgba(0, 0, 0, 0)\" class=\"has-inline-color has-vivid-cyan-blue-color\">Repository Sale Information</mark></a></li>\n\n\n\n<li><a href=\"https://luzernecountytaxclaim.com/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><mark style=\"background-color:rgba(0, 0, 0, 0)\" class=\"has-inline-color has-vivid-cyan-blue-color\">Luzerne County Tax Claim Bureau</mark></a></li>\n\n\n\n<li><a href=\"https://www.luzernecounty.org/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><mark style=\"background-color:rgba(0, 0, 0, 0)\" class=\"has-inline-color has-vivid-cyan-blue-color\">Luzerne County Official Website</mark></a></li>\n\n\n\n<li><a href=\"https://vault.taxlienschool.com/tax-deed/tax-deed-states/pennsylvania-tax-deeds/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><mark style=\"background-color:rgba(0, 0, 0, 0)\" class=\"has-inline-color has-vivid-cyan-blue-color\">Seize Unbeatable Deals on Pennsylvania Properties with Tax Deed Auctions!</mark></a></li>\n\n\n\n<li><a href=\"https://vault.taxlienschool.com/tax-deed/tax-deed-investing-overview/understanding-tax-deed-investing/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><mark style=\"background-color:rgba(0, 0, 0, 0)\" class=\"has-inline-color has-vivid-cyan-blue-color\">Let’s talk about Tax Deeds and how you can profit from them!</mark></a></li>\n\n\n\n<li><a href=\"https://youtu.be/ES5ZPyHRFMM?si=EmzhADUvwB_2FAAr\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><mark style=\"background-color:rgba(0, 0, 0, 0)\" class=\"has-inline-color has-vivid-cyan-blue-color\">Discover Tax Deeds and how you can find property for as little as $50!</mark></a></li>\n\n\n\n<li><a href=\"https://youtu.be/Ysq4_KdQSRg?si=SKw4Mg6hSnQBiDyN\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><mark style=\"background-color:rgba(0, 0, 0, 0)\" class=\"has-inline-color has-vivid-cyan-blue-color\">Unlock incredible real estate deals by buying cheap houses with Pennsylvania tax deeds</mark></a></li>\n</ul>\n\n\n\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\" id=\"Need-a-Hand?\">Need a Hand?</h3>\n\n\n\n<p>Get our free Tax Lien &amp; Deed Mini Course, or book a call with us to get a customized investing plan. Visit <a href=\"https://linktr.ee/dustinhahnrealestateinvesting\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><mark style=\"background-color:rgba(0, 0, 0, 0)\" class=\"has-inline-color has-vivid-cyan-blue-color\">Dustin Hahn Real Estate Investing</mark></a> for more details.</p>\n\n\n\n<p>Investing in tax liens and deeds can be a rewarding venture if done with the right knowledge and preparation. Luzerne County offers multiple opportunities to acquire properties at a fraction of their market value, but it requires careful planning and due diligence to succeed.</p>\n\n\n\n<p></p>\n<p><em>Sign up or log in to view the full content.</em></p><div id=\"popup-overlay\"></div><div id=\"signup-popup\" style=\"text-align: center; padding: 20px;\"><h4>Get Instant Free Access To The Training Vault Now</h4><p>Learn how to get 18-36% returns on your investment and buy property for as little as $500 with tax lien and tax deeds.</p><div class=\"video-container\" style=\"display: flex; justify-content: center; margin: 20px 0;\"><iframe src=\"https://youtube.com/embed/FkB-M8RaSHo\" allowfullscreen style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 560px; height: 315px; border: none; border-radius: 8px;\"></iframe></div><div class=\"button-container\" style=\"display: flex; flex-direction: column; align-items: center; gap: 10px;\"><button style=\"padding: 10px 20px; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">Sign Up for FREE Access</button><button style=\"padding: 10px 20px; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">Already a Member? Login</button></div></div>","upcomingCount":0}